truenas-initrd (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add truenas-grub.py. Stdlib-only script that lays down
    /etc/default/grub.d/truenas.cfg from a snapshot maintained on the live
    system at /data/subsystems/grub/truenas.cfg. Replaces the old
    middleware-importing script that ran via chroot during upgrades and was
    vulnerable to the same cross-BE Python ABI / syntax mismatches that
    motivated truenas-initrd.py's stdlib-only rewrite.

 -- TrueNAS Engineering <dev@truenas.com>  Tue, 12 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000

truenas-initrd (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. truenas-initrd.py and the stdlib-only upgrade_pyutils
    helper package, packaged together for installation under
    /usr/libexec/truenas-initrd/.

 -- TrueNAS Engineering <dev@truenas.com>  Mon, 27 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000
